hnote over WT, SAR #LightYellow:  Expanded path for peer 0 only. For peer i, WT sends peer_i's duress_placeholder with boomlet_i_identity_pubkey to peer i's selected SAR.
hnote over SAR #LavenderBlush:  SAR receives {duress_placeholder, boomlet_0_identity_pubkey, approved_withdrawal_id} from WT. It decrypts duress_placeholder using the Boomlet-to-SAR CBC/CMAC envelope context and sar_privkey \n to get duress_placeholder_plaintext. It classifies the plaintext as valid safe if it is all-zero 32-byte padding, valid duress if its derived doxing_data_identifier exists, \n or malformed otherwise. If it was valid duress and the tuple of approved_withdrawal_id, the received boomlet_0_identity_pubkey, and envelope IV of duress_placeholder was not previously saved, it uses \n duress_placeholder_plaintext which is equal to doxing_key_for_sar to decrypt the associated static_doxing_data_encrypted_by_doxing_key_for_sar and dynamic_doxing_data_encrypted_by_doxing_key_for_sar. It then uses \n this doxing_data to enter SEARCH AND RESCUE. For valid safe or duress placeholders, SAR signs duress_placeholder with sar_privkey and encrypts it with boomlet_0_identity_pubkey. \n Malformed placeholders are rejected before any acknowledgment is created.
hnote over SAR #Lavender:  duress_placeholder_plaintext := cbc_cmac_decrypt(keys: channel_keys(sar_privkey, "sar", boomlet_0_identity_pubkey, "boomlet", sender_public_key: boomlet_0_identity_pubkey, receiver_public_key: sar_pubkey), context: canonical_encode("withdrawal_duress_placeholder", approved_withdrawal_id), envelope: duress_placeholder)
hnote over SAR #Lavender:  is_safe_placeholder := (duress_placeholder_plaintext == zero_bytes_32) \n derived_doxing_data_identifier := tagged_sha256("Boomerang/doxing_data_identifier", duress_placeholder_plaintext) \n is_valid_duress_placeholder := (!is_safe_placeholder && sar_record_exists(derived_doxing_data_identifier))
hnote over SAR #Pink:  Assert is_safe_placeholder || is_valid_duress_placeholder
opt #LightBlue SEARCH AND RESCUE [is_valid_duress_placeholder and (approved_withdrawal_id, boomlet_identity_pubkey, duress_placeholder.iv) not previously saved]
hnote over SAR #Lavender:  doxing_data_identifier := derived_doxing_data_identifier \n doxing_key_for_sar := duress_placeholder_plaintext \n static_doxing_data := cbc_cmac_decrypt(keys: derive_cbc_cmac_keys(doxing_key_for_sar, "Boomerang/sar_stored_data"), context: canonical_encode("sar_static_data", doxing_data_identifier), envelope: static_doxing_data_encrypted_by_doxing_key_for_sar) \n  dynamic_doxing_data := cbc_cmac_decrypt(keys: derive_cbc_cmac_keys(doxing_key_for_sar, "Boomerang/sar_stored_data"), context: canonical_encode("sar_dynamic_data", doxing_data_identifier), envelope: dynamic_doxing_data_encrypted_by_doxing_key_for_sar) \n save(approved_withdrawal_id, boomlet_0_identity_pubkey, duress_placeholder.iv) \n Enter SEARCH_AND_RESCUE_MODE
end
